SUMMARY:20s & 30s After-Work Purgatory Chasm Hike with Ice Cream Social
LOCATION:198 Purgatory R\nSutton\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday\, June 9\, 2026 | 6:00 PM\nhttps://activities.outdoors
 .org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX0000019ViL2AU/\nJoin the Worcester 20s & 30s group
  for a visit to Purgatory Chasm in Sutton\, MA after-work on Tuesday\, Jun
 e 9th! The ~2.5 mile loop we will be doing will take us around the perimet
 er of the reservation\, as well as through the chasm itself\, which featur
 es many unique rock formations and crevices squeezes. We will split into t
 wo groups\, each with two leaders. Each group will start in a different di
 rection. Groups will be assigned based on timing of when you sign up. Afte
 r the hike\, we (optionally) will be heading over to West End Creamery for
  ice cream - only a 2-minute drive away!As an affinity group within AMC th
 at is dedicated to encouraging people in their 20s and 30s to enjoy the ou
 tdoors\, this is a trip for those in their 20s and 30s.
END:VEVENT
