SUMMARY:20s & 30s: The Jackalope Society
LOCATION:52 Main S\nNorthborough\, MA 01532
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, June 19\, 2026 | 7:00 PM\nhttps://activities.outdoors
 .org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX0000018YtZ2AU/\nTRAIL CULT PRESENTS...The Jackalop
 e Society cordially invites you to our Summer Formal. Huzzah.For generatio
 ns uncounted (and several likely not-yet-invented) the Jackalope Society h
 as convened / will convene twice annually to uphold the sacred principles 
 of merriment\, mystery\, and the honorable pursuit of becoming the strange
  thing glimpsed in the woods. As the AMC's premiere\, publicly-open secret
  order\, it is the Jackalope Society's privilege to welcome the various 20
 s & 30s members of our community to gather and ponder the overlap of the o
 utdoors and the weird.Attendance at this gathering shall entitle the beare
 r to an evening of:Unlicensed revelryThe democratic development of curious
  rites of questionable originPageantry and ceremonial nonsenseBootleg awar
 ds and unforeseen rewardsAttire is to be interpreted broadly\, but "formal
 " is the preferred means of garb. What does "formal" mean? Well\, by "form
 al" (and we are heavily applying air quotes) we mean whatever it is you ca
 re to mean. This includes but is not limited to: suits only worn during jo
 b interviews\, bridesmaid dresses banished to the backs of closets\, kilts
  dubiously purchased at renaissance festivals\, Canadian tuxedos\, a tie w
 orn over the sports jersey you slept in\, etc. "Formal" (air quotes still 
 included) is a state of mind\, not dress. Crushed velvet\, capes\, amulets
 \, and other inexplicable accessories are of course always appreciated as 
 well.The Jackalope Society Summer Formal will be held at the Northborough 
 Historical Society (52 Main St\, Northborough\, MA 01532) from 7:00pm - 9:
 00pm on June 19th. We are charging a $5 fee to provide snack-atizers. A fu
 ll meal will not be provided\, please arrive having dined. Beverages are o
 f the bring-your-own variety. Bringing a dish to share is also appreciated
 \, but certainly not required. If the $5 contribution to the hors d'œuvre
  fund is unmanageable\, attendance is still welcome and encouraged.With th
 ese summons\, consider yourself duly invited. May the moon favor your pass
 age\, the forest decline to remember your name\, and your RSVP be both joy
 ous and affirmative.This social is intended as a space for the 20s & 30s a
 ffinity to group to laugh\, goof-off\, and appreciate a nonsensical good-t
 ime. If you are not a member of the 20s & 30s affinity group\, please cons
 ider a different activity.
END:VEVENT
